SANTA DAS KARMAKAR:
Hello everyone.

00:09:24.190 --> 00:09:25.450
Good afternoon.

00:09:25.450 --> 00:09:27.783
This looks like a
movie star for me.

00:09:27.783 --> 00:09:28.950
