integration issues

00:39:40.610 --> 00:39:43.970
because the dependencies
across various components

00:39:43.970 --> 00:39:47.860
are actually identified
right at the planning stage.

00:39:47.860 --> 00:39:51.430
Along with that, this
tool also helps us

00:39:51.430 --> 00:39:55.220
for the stakeholder managements,
where we have big metrics

00:39:55.220 --> 00:39:57.740
and we know whom to contact
when you are migrating

00:39:57.740 --> 00:39:59.930
specific applications.

